        <mxCell id="8SxX1PG-NUlFmdvm8r1B-44" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Rules:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;No port-forwarding&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SSH Key only for all ssh access (Authorized_keys &lt;b&gt;must &lt;/b&gt;have a password)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vlan isolation (To understand and do later)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Strict Firewall for each VMs / LXC / PVEfirewall&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;All static IP for VMs / LXC&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic security updates for each VMs + LXC + Proxmox (host)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Back-up VMs + LXC daily at 2 A.M on NAS HDD local dataset Back-ups with retention 7 daily and 4 weekly&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Test back-ups regularly&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
